listing:   halo1d.cc
toolchain: mpirun (Open MPI) 4.1.6; g++ (Ubuntu 13.3.0-6ubuntu2~24.04.1) 13.3.0
command:   mpic++ -std=c++20 -O2 -Wall -Wextra -Wpedantic -Werror -DOMPI_SKIP_MPICXX halo1d.cc -o halo1d; for n in 1 2 4: mpirun --allow-run-as-root --oversubscribe -np $n ./halo1d
date:      2026-10-10T00:26:41Z
machine:   Linux x86_64 (cloud build container, 4 logical CPUs shared with other jobs; all MPI processes on this one machine, no GPU, no RDMA device)
exit code: 0
